cles on the sides showing 100% polyester macro texture and boba element accessories:1.1), (side color palette blocks in rose red, orange yellow, and red with HEX codes:1.1), (front and back line art flat sketches at the bottom 15 percent area:1.2), warm cafe lighting mixed with cinematic studio lighting, 8k resolution, highly detailed, (all text labels in Chinese:1.2).\n\n🎨 生产参数:\n\n*   **色卡信息:**\n    *   #E0218A (气质玫红 - 主身大面积使用，提升品牌时尚感)\n    *   #FFB300 (橘黄 - 用于围裙绑带、领口包边，增加活力与奶茶视觉联想)\n    *   #D32F2F (经典红 - 用于Logo刺绣与易磨损区域的拼接打底)\n*   **制作建议:**\n    *   **缝纫工艺：** 100%聚酯纤维在缝制时易产生缩皱，建议使用11号或9号细机针，搭配高弹涤纶线，并适当调松面线张力。\n    *   **加固与细节：** 带有“奶茶元素”的珍珠状装饰扣需采用四眼钉扣机加固防脱落；围裙口袋（用于放置点单机或温度计）需进行双层贴布与打枣（Bartack）加固处理，确保高频使用的耐用性。防泼水涂层需在成衣后整阶段进行高温定型。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 40, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 41, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [40, 61], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 398], "pos": [3694.79296875, 890.7067260742188], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "", "2,0", 0.6, 1457824247, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name